      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p03238",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "“他会不会这样理解？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Would he understand it that way?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p03238",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "他特地准备好，可是……他会不会责怪我们？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "He went out of his way to prepare everything, but... will he blame us?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p03238",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "他是真心诚意地款待我们，不想让我们回家啊。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "He was sincerely entertaining us and did not want us to go home.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p03238",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "要是我们老老实实待下去就好了。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "It would have been better if we had simply stayed there obediently.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p03238",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "他是不是感到寂寞呢？”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Was he feeling lonely?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
